[2026-03-14T21:56:18.598Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SnAv1pfGxoXbMM9HAbhGYS","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information I need. Let me create a comprehensive summary for you:\n\n## Linear Clone App - Complete Code & Architecture Analysis\n\n### 1. App Directory Name\n**`/repo/apps/LinearClone`**\n\n---\n\n### 2. Tests Documentation\nThe `docs/tests.md` file is extensive and contains detailed test specifications for all features including:\n- **Login/SignUp pages** (authentication)\n- **Team Issues page** (listing and filtering)\n- **Issue Detail page** (comprehensive specs for all features)\n- **Components**: IssueHeader, IssueDescription, SubIssues, ActivityComments, IssueSidebar\n- Multiple status, priority, assignee, labels, project, cycle, and due date management tests\n\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/docs/tests.md` (48k+ tokens)\n\n---\n\n### 3. Playwright Configuration\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/playwright.config.ts`\n\nConfiguration details:\n- Test directory: `./tests`\n- Timeout: 60 seconds per test\n- Expect timeout: 10 seconds\n- Fully parallel execution enabled\n- Reporter: Replay + JSON + HTML\n- Base URL: `http://localhost:8888`\n- Uses Replay Chromium device for recording\n\n---\n\n### 4. Existing Test Files (19 test files)\nLocated in `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/`:\n\n- `login.spec.ts`\n- `signup.spec.ts`\n- `sidebar.spec.ts`\n- `sidebar-navigation.spec.ts`\n- `sidebar-collapse.spec.ts`\n- `keyboard-shortcuts.spec.ts`\n- `my-issues.spec.ts`\n- `my-issues-row.spec.ts`\n- `my-issues-filters.spec.ts`\n- `inbox-list.spec.ts`\n- `notification-row.spec.ts`\n- `team-issues.spec.ts`\n- `team-issues-create.spec.ts`\n- `team-issues-row.spec.ts`\n- `team-issues-bulk-actions.spec.ts`\n- `team-issues-filters.spec.ts`\n- `team-issues-filters-advanced.spec.ts`\n- `group-by-sort-group.spec.ts`\n- `group-by-sort-sort.spec.ts`\n\n---\n\n### 5. Main Issue-Related Page Components\n\n#### **IssueDetail Page** \n**Location**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/IssueDetail.tsx`\n\n```typescript\n// Main component structure\n- Fetches issue detail via Redux dispatch\n- Uses useParams to get issueId from URL\n- Displays loading/error states\n- Layout with left panel (main) and right sidebar\n- Renders:\n  - IssueHeader (title + status)\n  - IssueDescription (markdown support)\n  - SubIssues list\n  - ActivityComments (activity/comments tabs)\n  - IssueSidebar (all properties)\n```\n\n**CSS**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/IssueDetail.css`\n- Main flex layout with sidebar\n- Responsive design (768px breakpoint for mobile)\n\n---\n\n#### **IssueHeader Component**\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/IssueHeader.tsx`\n\nKey features:\n- Displays issue identifier (e.g., \"ENG-1\")\n- Editable title (click to edit, save on blur or Enter, cancel with Escape)\n- Title input validation (can't be empty)\n- Inline status selector with dropdown\n- Status options: Backlog, Todo, In Progress, In Review, Done, Cancelled\n- Each status has colored icon\n- Dispatch updates via Redux to API\n\n**CSS**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/IssueHeader.css`\n- 24px title font\n- Hover effects on title for edit affordance\n- Status dropdown styling\n\n---\n\n#### **IssueDescription Component**\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/IssueDescription.tsx`\n\nKey features:\n- Click to edit textarea\n- Markdown rendering support (headings, bold, italic, code blocks, lists, paragraphs)\n- Auto-resizing textarea\n- Save on blur, cancel on Escape\n- Renders markdown to HTML with dangerouslySetInnerHTML\n- Placeholder text when empty\n- Supports:\n  - # ## ### headings\n  - **bold** and *italic*\n  - `inline code` and ```code blocks```\n  - - unordered lists\n  - 1. ordered lists\n\n**CSS**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/IssueDescription.css`\n\n---\n\n#### **IssueSidebar Component**\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/IssueSidebar.tsx`\n\nComplete properties sidebar with dropdowns:\n\n1. **Status field** - Dropdown with all 6 status options\n2. **Priority field** - Dropdown: Urgent, High, Medium, Low, No Priority\n3. **Assignee field** - Searchable dropdown with all team members\n4. **Labels field** - Multi-select picker showing all available labels with checkmarks\n5. **Project field** - Searchable dropdown for team projects\n6. **Cycle field** - Dropdown of team cycles\n7. **Due Date field** - HTML date input\n8. **Created** (read-only) - Formatted timestamp\n9. **Updated** (read-only) - Formatted timestamp\n\nAll dropdowns close on outside click. Search fields filter members/projects in real-time.\n\n**CSS**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/IssueSidebar.css`\n- Field styling with 11px uppercase labels\n- Dropdowns with overflow handling (max-height 280px)\n- Avatar circles (20px) with initials\n- Label badges with colored dots\n\n---\n\n### 6. Additional Components\n\n#### **SubIssues Component**\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/SubIssues.tsx`\n- Displays child issues of parent\n- Shows identifier, title (clickable), status icon, priority icon\n- \"Add sub-issue\" button functionality\n\n#### **ActivityComments Component**\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/ActivityComments.tsx`\n- Tab toggle between Activity and Comments\n- Activity shows chronological history with member info\n- Comments section with input and submit\n- Comment button disabled when input is empty\n\n#### **IssueRow Component**\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/IssueRow.tsx`\n\nDefines status and priority configurations:\n\n```typescript\nSTATUS_ORDER = ['backlog', 'todo', 'in_progress', 'in_review', 'done', 'cancelled']\n\nSTATUS_CONFIG with icons:\n- backlog: dashed circle\n- todo: empty circle\n- in_progress: half-filled circle\n- in_review: 3/4-filled circle\n- done: green check circle\n- cancelled: circle with X\n\nPRIORITY_CONFIG:\n- urgent: alert triangle icon\n- high: up arrow\n- medium: horizontal line\n- low: down arrow\n- none: three dots (ellipsis)\n```\n\n---\n\n### 7. Redux Slices\n\n#### **issueDetailSlice.ts**\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/slices/issueDetailSlice.ts`\n\nState structure:\n```typescript\ninterface IssueDetailState {\n  issue: Issue | null;\n  subIssues: SubIssue[];\n  activity: ActivityEntry[];\n  comments: Comment[];\n  members: TeamMember[];\n  projects: TeamProject[];\n  cycles: TeamCycle[];\n  allLabels: IssueLabel[];\n  loading: boolean;\n  error: string | null;\n}\n```\n\nAsync thunks:\n- `fetchIssueDetail(issueId)` - GET `/api/issue-detail?issueId={issueId}`\n- `updateIssueField(payload)` - PUT `/api/update-issue` with field, value, labelIds\n- `addComment(payload)` - POST `/api/add-comment`\n\n---\n\n#### **issuesSlice.ts**\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/slices/issuesSlice.ts`\n\nExports Issue and IssueLabel interfaces:\n```typescript\ninterface Issue {\n  id: string;\n  title: string;\n  description: string;\n  status: string;\n  priority: string;\n  identifier: string;\n  number: number;\n  dueDate: string | null;\n  createdAt: string;\n  updatedAt: string;\n  teamId: string;\n  teamName: string;\n  assigneeId: string | null;\n  assigneeName: string | null;\n  assigneeEmail: string | null;\n  projectId: string | null;\n  projectName: string | null;\n  cycleId: string | null;\n  parentId: string | null;\n  labels: IssueLabel[];\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 8. Seed Data\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/scripts/seed-db.ts`\n\nContains seeded test data:\n- **Workspace**: \"Acme Corp\"\n- **Members**: Alice Johnson, Bob Smith, Carol Davis (with hashed passwords)\n- **Teams**: Engineering (ENG), Design (DES)\n- **Labels**: Bug (red #ef4444), Feature (green #22c55e), Improvement (blue #3b82f6), Documentation (purple #a855f7)\n- **Project**: V2 Launch\n- **Cycle**: Sprint 12 (2026-03-10 to 2026-03-24)\n- **Issues** (Engineering):\n  - ENG-1: Fix login session expiration bug (in_progress, high, assigned to Alice, Bug label)\n  - ENG-2: Implement real-time notifications (todo, medium, assigned to Bob)\n  - ENG-3: Add dark mode toggle (backlog, low, unassigned)\n  - ENG-4: Optimize database queries (in_review, high, assigned to Carol)\n  - ENG-5: Write API documentation (done, medium, assigned to Bob)\n  - ENG-6: Fix broken pagination (todo, urgent, assigned to Alice)\n  - ENG-7: Add keyboard shortcuts help (backlog, none, unassigned)\n  - ENG-8: Implement issue search (in_progress, medium, assigned to Bob)\n\n---\n\n### 9. Netlify Functions (Issue-Related)\n\n#### **issue-detail.ts** (GET)\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/issue-detail.ts`\n\nFetches complete issue detail with:\n- Issue data (title, description, status, priority, dates)\n- Sub-issues list\n- Activity entries\n- Comments\n- Team members (for assignee dropdown)\n- Team projects\n- Team cycles\n- All labels\n\nReturns enriched issue object with team identifier, assignee name, project name, cycle name, etc.\n\n---\n\n#### **update-issue.ts** (PUT)\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/update-issue.ts`\n\nUpdates individual fields:\n- `title` - Changed title logs activity\n- `description` - Updates description, logs activity\n- `status` - Updates status with old→new label mapping, logs activity\n- `priority` - Updates priority with old→new label mapping, logs activity\n- `assigneeId` - Assigns/unassigns, creates notification for new assignee\n- `projectId` - Updates project assignment\n- `cycleId` - Updates cycle assignment\n- `dueDate` - Updates due date (can be null)\n- `labels` - Multi-label update (delete all, re-insert new ones)\n\nCreates activity entries for all changes. Returns updated issue object and latest activity entry.\n\n---\n\n#### Other Issue Functions\n- **team-issues.ts** - GET `/api/team-issues?teamId={teamId}` - Lists issues grouped by status\n- **create-issue.ts** - POST `/api/create-issue` - Creates new issue\n- **my-issues.ts** - GET `/api/my-issues` - Lists user's assigned issues\n- **search-issues.ts** - GET `/api/search-issues` - Fuzzy search issues\n- **bulk-update-issues.ts** - PUT `/api/bulk-update-issues` - Updates multiple issues\n- **update-issue-status.ts** - PUT `/api/update-issue-status` - Quick status update\n- **cycle-issues.ts** - GET `/api/cycle-issues?cycleId={cycleId}` - Lists cycle issues\n\n---\n\n### 10. Test Patterns (from existing tests)\n\nAll tests follow a pattern:\n\n```typescript\n// Helper functions for API calls\nasync function loginViaApi(baseURL, email, password)\nasync function getTeams(baseURL, token)\nasync function getTeamIssues(baseURL, token, teamId)\n\n// Login helper\nasync function loginAndNavigateToTeamIssues(page, baseURL, email, password)\n  - Calls API to login\n  - Gets teams\n  - Sets localStorage session token\n  - Navigates to page\n\n// Test structure\ntest.describe('ComponentName', () => {\n  test('specific behavior', async ({ page, baseURL }) => {\n    // Setup\n    // Action\n    // Verify with expect(page.getByTestId(...))\n  })\n})\n```\n\nData test IDs are used extensively for element selection.\n\n---\n\n### 11. Key Files Summary\n\n| File | Purpose | Size |\n|------|---------|------|\n| `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/IssueDetail.tsx` | Issue detail page layout & logic | ~77 lines |\n| `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/IssueHeader.tsx` | Title + status selector | ~140 lines |\n| `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/IssueDescription.tsx` | Markdown editor | ~150 lines |\n| `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/IssueSidebar.tsx` | All property dropdowns | ~420 lines |\n| `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/slices/issueDetailSlice.ts` | Redux state & API calls | ~192 lines |\n| `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/issue-detail.ts` | Backend fetch | ~246 lines |\n| `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/update-issue.ts` | Backend update | ~260 lines |\n| `/repo/apps/LinearClone/playwright.config.ts` | Test configuration | ~24 lines |\n| `/repo/apps/LinearClone/scripts/seed-db.ts` | Database seeding | ~198 lines |\n| `/repo/apps/LinearClone/docs/tests.md` | Complete test specs | 48k+ tokens |\n\n---\n\nThis comprehensive analysis gives you everything needed to understand the issue detail system, the components involved, the data flow, testing patterns, and the backend structure. All component source code is provided above with detailed explanations of functionality and styling."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a5332c38379c08705 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 72346\ntool_uses: 35\nduration_ms: 58152</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"30fcfe2a-f025-455e-bebe-907f186e0891","uuid":"7b6f522a-9f6e-4f4b-9bc3-cd238557df9e","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Find the linear-clone app in the /repo/apps directory. I need to understand:\n1. What's the app directory name?\n2. Read docs/tests.md in that app directory\n3. Read the playwright config\n4. List existing test files (*.spec.ts)\n5. Read the main page components related to issue detail/header/description (look for issue detail page, issue header, description components)\n6. Read any existing test files to understand patterns used\n7. Read the seed data file if it exists\n8. Read the netlify functions related to issues\n\nBe thorough - I need all component source code for issue detail page, status selector, description editor, and the issue header.","agentId":"a5332c38379c08705","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information I need. Let me create a comprehensive summary for you:\n\n## Linear Clone App - Complete Code & Architecture Analysis\n\n### 1. App Directory Name\n**`/repo/apps/LinearClone`**\n\n---\n\n### 2. Tests Documentation\nThe `docs/tests.md` file is extensive and contains detailed test specifications for all features including:\n- **Login/S